        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Level, momentum, one-off, and mechanism effects: the 6.950 million June level supplies the persistence anchor; positive multi-year growth adds 0.050 million; a judgmental small offset for weak technology hiring subtracts 0.020 million; no identified July-specific policy or classification change warrants another adjustment."
